[codex]    re-issuing blocking foreground waits until KAPSO_EVAL_MANIFEST is in
[codex]    your transcript. Only then write your final response. An evaluation you
[codex]    background and abandon scores nothing — the entire iteration is wasted.
[codex] 3. **Never alter evaluation behavior — at rest or at runtime.** Editing
[codex]    anything under `kapso_evaluation/`, rewriting protected data inputs,
[codex]    monkey-patching or hooking evaluation modules from your own code
